<description>&lt;p&gt;Journalist Tomás Beltrán was killed outside his home and two local election candidates were shot dead in El Oro, while a priest died when a crucifix fell during mass. An Ecuadorian thief pleaded guilty to participation in the largest U.S. jewelry heist, and a major Ecuadorian cocaine and weapons trafficking ring was busted in New York. Journalist Alaa Badarneh was injured in a West Bank settler attack. The crisis now includes high-profile transnational crimes and attacks on media figures beyond the prison gang violence that previously dominated, and UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE1oRXRQUF95bHFfeW1jM1E2dDhOMnMwWWRuRGxVMGp3dElscUxDTGR3aENpNEFOOHFWWGFiQm5PT1BDSko5Smk3SFE1NVN4a3hnMTZXdU9zQzZ4ZHEwak5XYXFIcXhXWFVsVExPWHJERDZNQlNZMHBqcmlIZUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQWnFRdzhhdTI3UGh6TTE3QmVYRTlQV0RfRHJFTWlKZVNONU51NDF3OFFQWVBhVFhsU01vTmFrdmx2b2FzODNxN19SR2sxMVNpajBCTHhOTXJNcWpnQ09mMjczbWRQc29EX0hBa3pjMWl5RHlrcHdzQmV4NGlxcmlSVy1neFRjU29CMWZlNDk5YkEwTGVMS0R4YW1XY1dxMlJQRUpYaWxzRXowLUU4ZUNj?oc=5&quot;&gt;SSBCrack&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOQkY5VzFBelJZOUVmV21rU0twZ2Z0S1RWOXJKd2YzSTJ6b0pfeVQwbDQxd0Z2NURLeFpwZ0lab1I2UnVHeWNwUjRpQWswU2V0a09fdC11YTVWdUFpVmRkM1RDLWRXUFZXSHBlc21ZMHFJT2tlc1FEOTFHOEVaM0JnbW5VZHhtWFU1Qm1iSm9iQ3BOOXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Journalism Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQVnAzbVJfUkxodlY0bkdiYWpfdlU5RzVzQS1FY2VqTGdDSFBQSVE0a0lmUTJ1d0VBczRVSVduSkxhV3ZxcVFLTDdRaEF2TV9qYi0wU09DUmd3c1I1OEtyMHB3bWNBNVJOSnRPM3llTjZoN2p6Z0djTjhpVFlObmNKNXdhaVk2ZDZBLURv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Lati